35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The last hire took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets. The yard is a mess.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Separately licensed pieces climbed yearly. Bundled held price.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. Four suppliers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. Testing takes weeks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, that explains the cost creep. We need stability.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, unowned support is a disaster. We need one throat to choke.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, if we can't upgrade, we are stuck with legacy.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, the yard is the real test. If it fails there, we fail.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, if we lose the admins, we lose the knowledge.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The supervisors dropped the new steps in weeks. Training is hard.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The peak season has no freeze window. Cutover is risky.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The board trims capital but passes operating costs. We are trapped.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The warehouse rules changed twice. The scope never held.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The 2018 data lift had errors for a year. Migration is risky.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,We need a vendor who stays and helps us learn.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Kenji,,We need something that works with our old scanners.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,We need a fixed cost structure. No surprises.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Yumi,,We need clear ownership. No pointing fingers.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,We need a system that can be upgraded without stopping.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
